123
00:05:29,617 --> 00:05:33,661
but it does expect And therefore here, I

124
00:05:33,774 --> 00:05:35,587
wanna reply, so to say,

125
00:05:36,261 --> 00:05:39,664
by sending back a string that contains HTML

126
00:05:39,809 --> 00:05:40,017
code.

127
00:05:41,189 --> 00:05:44,496
So by sending back text that contains HTML

128
00:05:44,688 --> 00:05:45,924
code in the end.

129
00:05:46,695 --> 00:05:49,167
And the Express framework, which I'm using

130
00:05:49,199 --> 00:05:52,441
