134
00:06:01,394 --> 00:06:04,738
which is then in turn telling HTMX that it's

135
00:06:04,803 --> 00:06:07,275
getting the data in the format it wants.

136
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,283
So therefore here, I wanna return an

